@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

actor "Client Browser" as Browser
component "API Gateway\n(Nginx)" as Gateway

component "Auth Service\n(FastAPI)" as Auth
component "User Service\n(FastAPI)" as User
component "Product Service\n(FastAPI)" as Product
component "Order Service\n(FastAPI)" as Order
component "Payment Service\n(FastAPI)" as Payment

database "Auth DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as AuthDB
database "User DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as UserDB
database "Product DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as ProductDB
database "Order DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as OrderDB
database "Payment DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as PaymentDB

queue "RabbitMQ\n(Event Bus)" as MQ
database "Redis\n(NoSQL Cache + Session)" as Redis

Browser --> Gateway : HTTPS REST

Gateway --> Auth : /auth/*
Gateway --> User : /users/*
Gateway --> Product : /products/*
Gateway --> Order : /orders/*
Gateway --> Payment : /payments/*

Auth --> AuthDB : CRUD users
User --> UserDB : CRUD profiles/addresses
Product --> ProductDB : CRUD catalog/reviews/images
Order --> OrderDB : CRUD orders
Payment --> PaymentDB : CRUD payments

Auth --> Redis : token session + blacklist
Product --> Redis : auth session validation\n+ seller/category cache

Auth --> MQ : AUTH_USER_REGISTERED
Order --> MQ : ORDER_CREATED / ORDER_PAID
Payment --> MQ : PAYMENT_CONFIRMED
User --> MQ : consume profile events
Product --> MQ : consume order/payment events (future)

note bottom of Product
Layered architecture target:
- Presentation (routers)
- Application (services)
- Domain (models/schemas)
- Infrastructure (db/redis/mq)
end note
@enduml
